./ R 00168000 00195000 $ 00168100 100                                           
*  THE DEDICATED-CHANNEL PASS-THROUGH IS GONE. IT ISSUED A     XA0018DK         
*  REAL CLRCH, DC X'9F01', FOR A GUEST WHOSE CHANNEL WAS       XA0018DK         
*  ATTACHED WHOLE. ESA/390 HAS NO CHANNEL TO CLEAR: RCHP B23B  XA0018DK         
*  RESETS A CHANNEL PATH, WHICH THE CHANNEL SUBSYSTEM OWNS     XA0018DK         
*  AND SHARES, AND IS A DIFFERENT OPERATION.                   XA0018DK         
*  CONVERTING IT WOULD BE WORSE THAN LEAVING IT. RCHP TAKES A  XA0018DK         
*  CHPID IN R1 BITS 24-31 AND PROGRAM-CHECKS ON BITS 0-23,     XA0018DK         
*  AND VCHADD IS X'0300' FOR CHANNEL 3. WORSE, CHP_RESET       XA0018DK         
*  CALLS DEVICE_RESET ON EVERY DEVICE ON THE PATH, WHICH       XA0018DK         
*  CLEARS PMCW5E AND THE INTERRUPTION PARAMETER -- SET ONCE    XA0018DK         
*  AT IPL BY XA0013DK AND NEVER AGAIN. ONE GUEST CLCH WOULD    XA0018DK         
*  DISABLE THE WHOLE CHANNEL FOR GOOD.                         XA0018DK         
*  SO CLCH IS ALWAYS A TCH NOW, AS IT ALREADY WAS FOR EVERY    XA0018DK         
*  CHANNEL THAT WAS NOT DEDICATED. DMKVSICH WANTS THE          XA0018DK         
*  REGISTERS DMKVSJ HELD AND NOTHING SINCE 00165000 TOUCHED    XA0018DK         
*  ONE, SO THE BRANCH IS UNCONDITIONAL AND STATE-IDENTICAL.    XA0018DK         
*  DMKVSJCC STILL COUNTS. I-62.                                XA0018DK         
         B     CLCHEXIT       SIMULATE CLCH AS A TCH           XA0018DK         
./ R 00324000          $ 00324010 010                                           
*  HSCH FOR HDV. THE CC0/CC2/CC3 PATHS FALL THROUGH WITH THE   XA0018DK         
*  CONDITION CODE INTACT, SINCE BC DOES NOT DISTURB IT. ONLY   XA0018DK         
*  CC1 NEEDS WORK: HSCH LEAVES STATUS PENDING WHERE HDV        XA0018DK         
*  STORED A CSW, AND HIOSTCSW READS CSW+4. I-67.               XA0018DK         
         L     R1,RDEVSSID-RDEVBLOK(R3)  SUBSYSTEM ID          XA0018DK         
         HSCH  0              HALT THE SUBCHANNEL              XA0018DK         
         BC    4,VSJHDV1      CC1: GO MAKE THE CSW REAL        XA0018DK         
         B     VSJHDV2        CC0, CC2, CC3 STAND AS THEY ARE  XA0018DK         
VSJHDV1  L     R1,RDEVSSID-RDEVBLOK(R3)  AGAIN, TSCH WANTS IT  XA0018DK         
         TSCH  IOBIRB-IOBLOK(R10)  CLEAR THE PENDING STATUS    XA0018DK         
         MVI   CSW,X'00'      REBUILD THE CSW HDV LEFT         XA0018DK         
         MVC   CSW+1(3),IOBICCW+1-IOBLOK(R10)                  XA0018DK         
         MVC   CSW+4(4),IOBIDST-IOBLOK(R10)                    XA0018DK         
         LA    R1,1           AND GIVE BACK CC1. LA THEN LCR:  XA0018DK         
         LCR   R1,R1          LTR ON 1 WOULD SET CC2. I-44.    XA0018DK         
VSJHDV2  DS    0H                                              XA0018DK         
